  "description": "Export presets (recording plan R6/R7 with R8, decision 100) on the authored bevelled cube at 256 px, OpenGL, no template (the pipeline's default OpenPBR channels BaseColor, SpecularRoughness, BaseMetalness, Height, Normal), under OCIO: normal-b bound as the Normal mesh map and grey A as AO; one fill with field A, grey A, grey B, the height ramps, normal-a (and grey A on Opacity). Captures: the predefined and resource export presets, every predefined preset's output maps on the set, and the output maps of the starter PBR Metallic Roughness and Blender (Principled BSDF) presets. Probes: each starter preset with its own parameters and with the pipeline's (PNG 16, infinite, no dithering); the Assets3D inline five-map preset (staff-v10 painter_export.py) at sizeLog2 8 and 7.",
